gets 2.07, both are fine.

103
00:07:20.688 --> 00:07:24.980
The electrical length
is 2 pi times 0.3, 0.6

104
00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:30.755
pi, 108 degrees, whose
tangent is minus 3.078.

105
00:07:30.805 --> 00:07:34.965
Substituting in the input impedance
formula, the numerator is 40 minus j

106
