129
00:09:45.703 --> 00:09:51.406
The return loss is minus
20 log of 0.2, 13.98 dB.

130
00:09:51.456 --> 00:09:56.789
So of the input power, 89 % comes
out, 4 % is reflected at the input,

131
00:09:56.829 --> 00:10:01.918
and the remaining 7 % is lost in the
circuit and in the output mismatch.

132
